It goes without saying... GeoGuessr!

175
00:12:22,023 --> 00:12:24,523
のじゃーーー！
Yeah!

176
00:12:26,023 --> 00:12:35,023
GeoGuessr... やはり、私達を今一番繋いで、一番私達が、特に語りたいと思っていることが...
GeoGuessr... That's what connects us most right now, and what we want to talk about most...

177
00:12:34,823 --> 00:12:36,023
