You'd expect people to list them, but just one?!

192
00:13:31,823 --> 00:13:32,523
はい。
Yep.

193
00:13:32,523 --> 00:13:35,023
だけ？！そしてGeoGuessr？！
Only one?! And it's GeoGuessr?!

194
00:13:35,023 --> 00:13:36,023
はい！
Yes!

195
00:13:36,023 --> 00:13:37,523
そんなことある？
How is that even possible?

196
00:13:38,023 --> 00:13:41,023
もはやこれはもう運命と言いましょう！
We can only call this fate!

197
00:13:41,023 --> 00:13:45,223
え〜！そんなことある？というね、運命的な...
Wow! Is that really possible? It feels so miraculous...

198
00:13:45,523 --> 00:13:47,023
そこが出会いですね。
That's how we connected.

199
00:13:47,023 --> 00:13:48,523
はい、はい。
Yes, yes.

200
00:13:48,823 --> 00:13:51,023
AZKi先輩はGeoGuessrを始めて3年...
AZKi-senpai has been playing GeoGuessr for 3 years...

201
00:13:51,223 --> 00:13:54,223
そうです、3年くらいで...
That's right, about 3 years...

202
00:13:53,523 --> 00:13:54,823
うん、うん。
Mm-hmm.

203
00:13:55,023 --> 00:13:59,223
そう、ちょっとこの後にも書いてあるんですけど...
Right, it's also written below, but...

204
00:13:59,523 --> 00:14:08,523
3年前にちょうどあのー、ホロライブ全体でGeoGuessr配信が流行った時期がありまして...
3 years ago, there was a trend across Hololive where everyone was streaming GeoGuessr...

205
00:14:08,523 --> 00:14:10,023
ありましたね。
There was.

